{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56707","headline":"筠山虎 · 无名氏","name":"筠山虎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"筠山高极入穹苍，人道虎爲殃。\n人行过此不曾伤。\n咸阳宫阙在平地，高鹿食人无所计，吁嗟苛政猛於虎，斯言垂万古。\n（见同治三年刊文良等修《嘉定府志》卷四十。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56707.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56707","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}